From 45bff0792936f9929ae0e5288ce1668339ecd1d6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "sh.chao" <sh.chao@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 17 Jul 2026 18:52:21 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] r25-1-0089: draw exact Darken coverage spans

Extend the r25-1 unified RenderProgram backend with a fail-closed AGG path for fill-only or stroke-only Darken path objects. Rasterize each PDF object in painter order and feed its coverage directly to PDFium's existing Darken scanline compositor, eliminating the temporary BGRA transparency bitmap and its second pixel pass without grouping objects or changing integer blend semantics. Unsupported transparency, object-clip, pattern, group, printer, destination-format, and mixed fill/stroke cases fall back before destination mutation. Add admission/runtime telemetry and arithmetic equivalence coverage for BGR, BGRX, and BGRA destinations.
